WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:06.009
Today, I'm starting with a correction last
week in discussing a White House press secretary,

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:13.540
Kayleigh McEnany, claim that the odds of what
happened in terms of the vote in four different

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.360
states were one in one quadrillion.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:22.839
She also said the odds of that happening in
four states is one in one quadrillion raised

00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:24.029
to the fourth power.

00:00:24.029 --> 00:00:28.409
I, with no explanation, said that's not how
exponents work.

00:00:28.409 --> 00:00:33.270
That was very unclear and really inaccurate
in the context in which I said it.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:38.030
If one in one quadrillion were the right numbers
at the state level, raising it to the fourth

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:42.020
power would give us the combined probability.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.560
In theory, that is how exponents work.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.750
By not explaining, I may have not been clear
and I apologize for that.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.220
I will try to do better in the future.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.910
Let's get on to the week's news.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:58.890
It's a truly a tragedy what's going on in
this country in general.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.830
But I'm talking right now about coronavirus.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:05.180
I get that we're a huge country geographically.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:06.860
We have three hundred and thirty million people.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:08.330
I get that.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:11.660
But we are some of the worst of the worst
in the world.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.479
And we are now having a nine elevens worth
of deaths on one day regularly.

00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:23.140
And the numbers are potentially going to get
much worse before they get any better.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:27.960
Now, I know many people on the right, including
Donald Trump, like to say, well, everyone

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.290
is seeing the same thing.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.720
That could not be further from the truth.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:35.720
And I want to examine that with you today
because we really need to understand just

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.080
how terribly we are doing the claim.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.180
Is everyone seeing the same thing.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.000
Cases are spiking here, cases are spiking
there.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.750
Italy's, you know, Sweden, whatever.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:55.590
That's mostly based on this spike in mid-October
that we started seeing, just like many other

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.240
European countries.

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.800
But there are two really important differences
to understand here.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:08.200
The first is that when the U.S. started seeing
its October spike, that was already our third

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:12.290
spike because we had Spike number one in April
and Spike number two in July.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:16.650
So middle of October, we're on spike number
three.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:21.990
That's a key difference because in Italy,
for example, their mid-October spike was only

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.030
their second spike.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:29.280
In other words, Italy successfully suppressed
the virus throughout May, June, July, August,

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.050
September, early October.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.349
So when we were entering Spike three and they
were also spiking, they were only on their

00:02:35.349 --> 00:02:36.349
second spike.

00:02:36.349 --> 00:02:37.780
So that's a huge difference.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:41.720
And that applies to just about all of these
European countries that did not have the second

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.959
spike we had.

00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:48.780
Just as importantly, these European countries
that started getting a spike when we did in

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.420
mid-October.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:55.099
Most of them have already suppressed the spike
and they've seen a decline from the highs

00:02:55.099 --> 00:02:57.160
of about 50 percent of new cases per day.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:03.140
So as an example, we look at Spain and you
see that, yes, Spain started having spike

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:07.680
number two at the same time that we started
having a spike, number three.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:12.040
But their trend line for the seven day case
average is already down by half from where

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.040
it peaked.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.690
If you look at another example like France,
you also see that while they spiked in mid-October,

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.640
like we did there, cases are already way down.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:25.160
But when you look at the United States, we
have this spike that started at the same time,

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:28.010
but we are reaching new records just about
every day.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:32.980
This has been one of the biggest failures
of any presidential administration ever.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:40.240
It's globally shameful, but it is a tragedy
in terms of its its toll on human life and

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.240
suffering.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.920
And it's going to take time to fix this.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.510
Now, there's no way around it.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:49.500
And we know that on January 21st, every coronavirus
death will be blamed on Joe Biden by these

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.710
Republicans.

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:55.560
All I care is that we fix it if now they want
to start wearing masks and social distancing

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.080
because Biden's president then do it in order
to show.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.360
I don't know what I don't think that that's
going to be the reaction.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:05.610
And of course, it's too late for the three
hundred thousand people that died already.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:10.650
It's too late for the many that recovered
from serious cases of the virus and still

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.140
have symptoms and unknown long term effects
that we don't yet understand.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:22.019
The good news is the FDA has approved an emergency
use authorization for the Pfizer Bion tech

00:04:22.019 --> 00:04:23.019
vaccine.

00:04:23.019 --> 00:04:27.180
I've been saying Biogen tech, but someone
told me it's beyond tech that is approved.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:31.660
And we're going to talk about vaccination
momentarily, December 17th, which is what

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.660
is that?

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:35.970
Thursday, the FDA will be meeting about the
Moderna vaccine.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:40.970
And we'll have more detailed report later
in the week about that, if indeed it is approved.

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:43.419
And we'll talk more about vaccines momentarily.

00:04:43.419 --> 00:04:46.570
But this is a cautionary tale about what not
to do.

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:49.550
This is not about taking you know, it's so
depressing.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:55.919
Don Junior, early in this entire fiasco, said,
oh, Democrats want people to die to make Trump

00:04:55.919 --> 00:04:56.919
look bad.

00:04:56.919 --> 00:04:57.940
No, I have not.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.120
I've not found a single person.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:02.360
On the left are a Democrat who wants people
to die.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:07.270
What we do want is that those responsible
for the failed leadership be held accountable.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.170
In a sense, Trump was because he lost the
election.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:13.639
But this is really a cautionary tale about
what not to do.

00:05:13.639 --> 00:05:19.060
And part of what not to do is don't elect
a buffoonish and competent clown to be president

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.060
of the United States.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:06:42.930
Let's talk 
about vaccination.

